1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:26,000
SPEAKERA: The reflector made Enigma convenient. It also meant no letter could ever be itself.

2
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:56,000
SPEAKERB: On its own, that flaw wasn't enough.

3
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:26,000
SPEAKERA: No. But add German habits, captured papers and thousands of patient people, and it was.

4
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:56,000
SPEAKERB: Press A, and you could get any letter at all, except A.
